project := "native-app"

llm codex [model=gpt-5-codex]

task configure [doc=Configure CMake build directory]:
    !cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug

task build: configure [timeout=2m, doc=Build with CMake]:
    !cmake --build build -j

task test: build [timeout=2m, doc=Run CTest and explain failures]:
    !ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
    If any C or C++ tests failed, explain the likely root cause and suggest the smallest fix.

task review-compile-commands [llm=codex, doc=Review compile_commands.json for risky flags]:
    Read build/compile_commands.json if it exists.
    Look for missing warnings, unsafe optimization/debug combinations, and portability risks.
